  "notes": "USAGE: {発展|はってん} emphasizes broader societal, economic, or relational progress. Compare with {発達|はったつ} which focuses on organic/individual development.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{発展|はってん}する (to develop, to expand)\n・{発展|はってん}させる (to develop something)\n・{発展|はってん}に{貢献|こうけん}する (to contribute to development)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{発展|はってん}{途上国|とじょうこく} (developing country)\n・{経済|けいざい}{発展|はってん} (economic development)\n・{発展|はってん}{的|てき} (developmental, progressive)\n・{持続|じぞく}{可能|かのう}な{発展|はってん} (sustainable development)\n\nCONTRAST:\n・{発展|はってん} - development (scale, society, relationships)\n・{発達|はったつ} - development (organic, individual)\n・{開発|かいはつ} - development (creating new things)\n・{進歩|しんぽ} - progress",
